  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed for machines, factories, power plants, servers, and other systems that run continuously. Also used in business for labor metrics like {稼働|かどう}{時間|じかん} (working hours) and {稼働|かどう}{率|りつ} (utilization rate / uptime).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {稼働|かどう}する (to operate, to run)\n- {稼働|かどう}{率|りつ} (utilization rate, uptime)\n- {稼働|かどう}{時間|じかん} (operating hours)\n- {稼働|かどう}{日数|にっすう} (number of working days)\n- {本格的|ほんかくてき}に{稼働|かどう}する (to begin full-scale operation)\n\nWATCH OUT:\n- {華道|かどう}: the art of flower arrangement — same reading, completely different meaning",
